			"notes": "Initial release for 26.1. One notable change:\n\n- 🛠️ **Adjusted crafting recipe for potion cones**\n  \n  The crafting recipe for potion cones is changed to use 8 snow cones rather than 4 snow cones. This aligns the recipe with the crafting recipe for tipped arrows. The duration of the resulting potion cones remains the same as before (an 1/8th of the original potion).\n\n**Commit log**: [`1.21.11-v1.17.0..26.1-v1.18.0`](https://github.com/sciwhiz12/SnowyWeaponry/compare/1.21.11-v1.17.0..26.1-v1.18.0)"
