			"notes": "Initial release for 1.21.8. No new features, only a single bugfix.\n\n- The looting level applied to a mob's drops is the maximum of the thrown golden-cored snowball and the enchantment of the player's held item. (Previously, the looting level of the thrown golden-cored snowball always overrides the held item's enchantment.)\n\n**Commit log**: [`1.21.5-v1.14.0...1.21.8-v1.15.0`](https://github.com/sciwhiz12/SnowyWeaponry/compare/1.21.5-v1.14.0...1.21.8-v1.15.0)"
